:: Hud Styles [stylesheet]
/* fixed hotbar at the bottom of the screen */
#hud { position: sticky; top: 8px; z-index: 900; display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: fit-content; margin: 0 auto 12px;
  padding: 10px 14px 12px; background: rgba(9, 13, 26, .94); border: 1px solid #3a4a73; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.6); max-width: calc(100vw - 24px); }
#hud.on { display: flex; }
#hud .top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
#hud .lbl { letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .75rem; color: #9db8ff; }
#hud .bar { width: 180px; height: 12px; background: #26304d; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; }
#hud .bar span { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; transition: width .4s ease, background-color .4s ease; }
#hud .num { min-width: 2.2em; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: bold; }
#hud .quick { border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid #4fd18b; background: #143224; color: #c9ffe0; padding: .25em .9em; cursor: pointer; font-size: .85rem; }
#hud .quick:hover { background: #1f4d36; }
#hud .slots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 60px); gap: 6px; }
#hud .slot { position: relative; width: 60px; height: 60px; padding: 4px 2px 0; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #3a4a73; background: #121a30; color: #fff;
  font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; cursor: default; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
#hud .slot small { display: block; font-size: 9.5px; line-height: 1.1; color: #c7d2f0; margin-top: 2px; }
#hud .slot .x { position: absolute; top: -6px; right: -6px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3a1418; border: 1px solid #ff6b6b; color: #ffd0d0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 16px; text-align: center; opacity: .75; }
#hud .slot .x:hover { opacity: 1; background: #7a1d24; }
#hud .slot .key { position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 5px; font-size: 9px; color: #6c7899; }
#hud .slot.full { cursor: pointer; border-color: #5b8cff; background: #17233f; }
#hud .slot.full:hover { background: #24366a; transform: translateY(-2px); }
#hud .slot.full.drinkable { border-color: #4fd18b; }
#hud .info { font-size: .85rem; color: #c7d2f0; min-height: 1.2em; text-align: center; max-width: 420px; }
#hud .info b { color: #ffd76b; }
#hud .slot.sel { outline: 2px solid #ffd76b; outline-offset: 1px; }
#hud .acts { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
#hud .act { border-radius: 99px; padding: .15em .8em; font-size: .8rem; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #5b8cff; background: #17233f; color: #fff; }
#hud .act.drinkit { border-color: #4fd18b; background: #143224; color: #c9ffe0; }
#hud .act.drop { border-color: #ff6b6b; background: #3a1418; color: #ffd0d0; }
#hud .act:hover { filter: brightness(1.3); }
@media (max-width: 480px) { #hud .slots { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 48px); } #hud .slot { width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 20px; } #hud .slot small { display: none; } #hud .bar { width: 120px; } }
#toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 24px; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #17233f; border: 1px solid #5b8cff; color: #fff; padding: .55em 1.2em; border-radius: 99px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .3s; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1000; }
#toast.show { opacity: 1; }
.find { text-align: center; margin: 0 auto 10px; }
.find a { display: inline-block; padding: .4em 1.1em; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid #4fd18b; background: #143224; color: #c9ffe0; text-decoration: none; animation: findpulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
.find a:hover { background: #1f4d36; }
@keyframes findpulse { 0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(79,209,139,.5); } 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(79,209,139,0); } }
@keyframes wobble { 0%, 100% { transform: none; } 50% { transform: skewX(1.2deg) scale(1.015); } }
@keyframes jitter { 0%, 100% { transform: none; } 25% { transform: translate(1px, -1px); } 75% { transform: translate(-1px, 1px); } }
body.low .scene { filter: saturate(1.5) contrast(1.15) brightness(.92); animation: wobble 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
body.critical .scene { filter: saturate(2) contrast(1.3) blur(.6px) sepia(.25); animation: wobble 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
body.critical .story-text { animation: jitter .25s steps(2) infinite; }
.hotspot { position: absolute; display: block; cursor: pointer; }
@keyframes flicker { 0%, 17%, 19.5%, 21%, 58%, 61%, 100% { filter: none; } 18%, 20%, 59.5% { filter: brightness(.3); } }
body.flicker .scene { animation: flicker 5s infinite; }
@keyframes partyhue { 0%, 100% { filter: none; } 50% { filter: brightness(1.12) saturate(1.15); } }
body.fun .scene { animation: partyhue 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
.codepad { width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; margin: 6px auto 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #1f2937; border: 2px solid #6b7280; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.codepad .cscreen { background: #052e16; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.codepad .cin { width: 100%; min-width: 220px; box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; border: 0; outline: 0; color: #4ade80; font: bold 1.4rem monospace; letter-spacing: .25em; text-align: center; }
.codepad .cin::placeholder { color: #166534; letter-spacing: .05em; font-size: .9rem; }
.codepad .ckeys { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 46px); gap: 6px; justify-content: center; }
.codepad .ckeys.colors { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 76px); }
.codepad .ck { height: 42px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #4b5563; background: #374151; color: #e5e7eb; font: bold 1rem monospace; cursor: pointer; }
.codepad .ck:hover { filter: brightness(1.25); }
.codepad .ck.color { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #000; text-transform: capitalize; }
.codepad .ck.go { background: #14532d; border-color: #4ade80; color: #bbf7d0; }
.codepad .ck.clr { background: #3a1418; border-color: #ef4444; color: #fecaca; font-size: .8rem; }
.codepad .cmsg { min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; font: bold .9rem monospace; color: #fca5a5; }
.codepad.ok { border-color: #4ade80; } .codepad.ok .cmsg { color: #4ade80; }
@keyframes padshake { 0%, 100% { transform: none; } 20%, 60% { transform: translateX(-8px); } 40%, 80% { transform: translateX(8px); } }
.codepad.bad { animation: padshake .35s; border-color: #ef4444; }

:: Hud Script [script]
setup.ITEMS = {
  almond: { name: 'Almond water', short: 'Water', icon: '\u{1F4A7}', desc: 'Drink it if things become distorted or you see smiles.' },
  sword:  { name: 'Sword', short: 'Sword', icon: '\u{1F5E1}\u{FE0F}', desc: 'Sharp. Might help in a fight.' },
  code:   { name: 'Code note', short: 'Code', icon: '\u{1F4DD}', desc: 'The ink got wet and smudged. You can\'t read it anymore. Hope you remember it.' },
  roomkey:{ name: 'Room 213 key', short: 'Key 213', icon: '\u{1F5DD}\u{FE0F}', desc: 'A gold hotel key on a red tag: 213.' },
  brasskey:{ name: 'Brass key', short: 'Brass', icon: '\u{1F511}', desc: 'Heavy and warm. It says BOILER.' },
  sheet:  { name: 'Sheet music', short: 'Music', icon: '\u{1F3BC}', desc: 'The numbers at the top are smeared. You will have to remember them.' },
  hat:    { name: 'Party hat', short: 'Hat', icon: '\u{1F973}', desc: 'Partygoers like hats. Maybe they will think you are one of them.' },
  flashlight: { name: 'Flashlight', short: 'Light', icon: '\u{1F526}', desc: 'Some things in the dark hate light.' },
  crowbar:{ name: 'Crowbar', short: 'Crowbar', icon: '\u{1F527}', desc: 'Heavy and red. Good for prying doors, or hitting things.' }
};
setup.SLOTS = 6;      /* inventory size */
setup.DRAIN = 3;      /* sanity lost every scene */
setup.FUN_DRAIN = 6;  /* Level Fun drains sanity faster */
setup.reset = function () {
  var v = State.variables; v.sanity = 100; v.inv = []; v.taken = {};
  v.virusWith = false; v.power = false; v.codeTries = 0; v.knowCode = false; v.bell = 0;
};
setup.drainFor = function (p) { return p.tags.indexOf('fun') >= 0 ? setup.FUN_DRAIN : setup.DRAIN; };
setup.has = function (id) { return (State.variables.inv || []).indexOf(id) >= 0; };
setup.hasWeapon = function () { return setup.has('sword') || setup.has('crowbar'); };
setup.isTaken = function (k) { return !!(State.variables.taken || {})[k]; };
setup.take = function (k, id) { var v = State.variables; v.taken = v.taken || {}; if (v.taken[k]) { return false; } if (setup.addItem(id)) { v.taken[k] = true; return true; } return false; };
setup.toast = function (msg) {
  var t = $('#toast'); if (!t.length) { t = $('<div id="toast"></div>').appendTo('body'); }
  t.text(msg).addClass('show'); clearTimeout(setup._tt); setup._tt = setTimeout(function () { t.removeClass('show'); }, 2200);
};
setup.addItem = function (id) {
  var v = State.variables; v.inv = v.inv || [];
  if (setup.has(id) && id !== 'almond') { return false; }
  if (v.inv.length >= setup.SLOTS) { setup.toast('Your inventory is full'); return false; }
  v.inv.push(id); setup.toast('Picked up: ' + setup.ITEMS[id].name); setup.hud(); return true;
};
/* drinking from a button that also moves to the next scene: top up past 100 so the next scene's drain lands on 100 */
setup.fill = function (beforeMove) { State.variables.sanity = 100 + (beforeMove ? setup.DRAIN : 0); setup.toast('You drink the almond water. Your mind clears.'); setup.hud(); };
setup.drink = function () {
  var v = State.variables, i = (v.inv || []).indexOf('almond');
  if (i < 0) { return false; }
  v.inv.splice(i, 1); setup.fill(false); return true;
};
/* clicking a slot selects it and offers Drink (water) and Discard */
setup.useSlot = function (i) {
  var v = State.variables, id = (v.inv || [])[i], it = setup.ITEMS[id];
  if (!it) { return; }
  $('#hud .slot').removeClass('sel'); $('#hud .slot[data-i="' + i + '"]').addClass('sel');
  $('#hud .info').html('<b>' + it.name + '</b> &mdash; ' + it.desc + '<span class="acts">' +
    (id === 'almond' ? '<button class="act drinkit" data-i="' + i + '">Drink</button>' : '') +
    '<button class="act ask" data-i="' + i + '">Discard</button></span>');
};
/* dropping always asks first so nothing gets dropped by accident */
setup.askDiscard = function (i) {
  var id = (State.variables.inv || [])[i], it = setup.ITEMS[id];
  if (!it) { return; }
  $('#hud .slot').removeClass('sel'); $('#hud .slot[data-i="' + i + '"]').addClass('sel');
  $('#hud .info').html('Drop the <b>' + it.name + '</b>? You can' + "'" + 't get it back.<span class="acts">' +
    '<button class="act drop" data-i="' + i + '">Yes, drop it</button><button class="act keep">Keep it</button></span>');
};
setup.discard = function (i) {
  var v = State.variables, id = (v.inv || [])[i], it = setup.ITEMS[id];
  if (!it) { return; }
  v.inv.splice(i, 1); setup.hud(); setup.toast('You dropped the ' + it.name.toLowerCase());
};
setup.noDrain = function (p) { return p.tags.indexOf('nodrain') >= 0 || p.tags.indexOf('ending') >= 0; };
Config.navigation.override = function (dest) {
  var p = Story.get(dest);
  if (!p || setup.noDrain(p)) { return; }
  if ((State.variables.sanity || 0) - setup.drainFor(p) <= 0) { return 'Lost Your Mind'; }
};
$(document).on(':passageinit', function (ev) {
  if (setup.noDrain(ev.passage)) { return; }
  var v = State.variables; if (typeof v.sanity !== 'number') { v.sanity = 100; }
  v.sanity = Math.max(0, v.sanity - setup.drainFor(ev.passage));
});
setup.hud = function () {
  var v = State.variables, s = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, v.sanity || 0)), inv = v.inv || [];
  $('body').toggleClass('low', s < 35 && s >= 15).toggleClass('critical', s < 15);
  var h = $('#hud'); if (!h.length) { h = $('<div id="hud"></div>').insertBefore('#passages'); }
  var col = s >= 60 ? '#4fd18b' : s >= 35 ? '#ffd76b' : '#ff6b6b';
  var waters = inv.filter(function (x) { return x === 'almond'; }).length;
  var slots = '';
  for (var i = 0; i < setup.SLOTS; i++) {
    var id = inv[i], it = setup.ITEMS[id];
    slots += it
      ? '<button class="slot full' + (id === 'almond' ? ' drinkable' : '') + '" data-i="' + i + '" title="' + it.name + (id === 'almond' ? ' (click to drink or discard)' : '') + '"><span class="key">' + (i + 1) + '</span>' + it.icon + '<small>' + it.short + '</small></button>'
      : '<span class="slot"><span class="key">' + (i + 1) + '</span></span>';
  }
  h.html('<div class="top"><span class="lbl">Sanity</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:' + s + '%;background:' + col + '"></span></div><span class="num">' + Math.round(s) + '</span>' +
    (waters ? '<button class="quick">\u{1F4A7} Drink almond water (' + waters + ')</button>' : '') + '</div>' +
    '<div class="slots">' + slots + '</div><div class="info">' + (inv.length ? 'Click an item or press 1-6 to use or drop it' : 'Your inventory is empty') + '</div>');
};
$(document).on(':passagedisplay', function (ev) {
  var t = ev.passage.tags, show = !(t.indexOf('nohud') >= 0 || t.indexOf('ending') >= 0);
  setup.hud();
  $('#hud').toggleClass('on', show); $('body').toggleClass('hud-on', show);
  if (!show) { $('body').removeClass('low critical'); }
});
$(document).on('click', '#hud .slot.full', function (e) {
  var i = +$(this).attr('data-i');
  if (e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) { setup.askDiscard(i); return; }
  setup.useSlot(i);
});

$(document).on('click', '#hud .quick', function () { setup.drink(); });
$(document).on('click', '#hud .drinkit', function () { var v = State.variables, i = +$(this).attr('data-i'); v.inv.splice(i, 1); setup.fill(false); });
$(document).on('click', '#hud .drop', function () { setup.discard(+$(this).attr('data-i')); });
$(document).on('click', '#hud .ask', function () { setup.askDiscard(+$(this).attr('data-i')); });
$(document).on('click', '#hud .keep', function () { setup.hud(); });
/* direct links: index.html#level-fun etc. jump straight into the new levels */
setup.JUMPS = { 'level-1': 'Level 1', 'level-fun': 'Level Fun', 'party-chase': 'Party Chase', 'fun-exits': 'Level Fun Exits', 'dark-hall': 'Level 1 Dark Hall', 'virus-fun': 'Fun With The Virus', 'level-2': 'Level 2 Pipe Dreams', 'level-4': 'Level 4 Abandoned Office', 'level-6': 'Level 6 Lights Out', 'level-run': 'Level Run For Your Life', 'hotel': 'Hotel Arrival' };
$(document).one(':storyready', function () {
  var dest = setup.JUMPS[location.hash.slice(1)];
  if (dest) { setTimeout(function () { Engine.play(dest); setup.reset(); setup.addItem('almond'); }, 0); }
});
$(document).on('keydown', function (e) {
  if (!$('#hud').hasClass('on') || e.altKey || e.metaKey || $(e.target).is('input, textarea')) { return; }
  /* e.code so Shift+1 still reads as 1 (not "!") */
  var m = /^(?:Digit|Numpad)(\d)$/.exec(e.code || ''), n = m ? +m[1] : parseInt(e.key, 10);
  if (!(n >= 1 && n <= setup.SLOTS)) { return; }
  /* Ctrl+number discards (most browsers keep Ctrl+1-6 for tabs, so Shift+number does too) */
  if (e.ctrlKey || e.shiftKey) { e.preventDefault(); setup.askDiscard(n - 1); return; }
  setup.useSlot(n - 1);
});

/* code pads: the player has to remember the code and type it in.
   <div class="codepad" data-kind="digits|colors" data-len="3" data-ok="Passage" data-fail="boiler" data-answer="417"></div> */
setup.COLORS = { r: ['red', '#dc2626'], b: ['blue', '#2563eb'], g: ['green', '#16a34a'], y: ['yellow', '#eab308'] };
setup.normCode = function (kind, s) {
  s = String(s || '').toLowerCase();
  if (kind === 'colors') {
    /* accept "red blue green yellow", "red, blue..." or "rbgy" */
    var words = s.match(/[a-z]+/g) || [];
    if (words.length === 1 && /^[rbgy]+$/.test(words[0])) { return words[0]; }
    return words.map(function (w) { return w.charAt(0); }).join('');
  }
  return s.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
};
setup.buildPad = function (el) {
  var pad = $(el), kind = pad.attr('data-kind') || 'digits', keys = '';
  if (kind === 'colors') {
    Object.keys(setup.COLORS).forEach(function (k) {
      keys += '<button type="button" class="ck color" data-add="' + setup.COLORS[k][0] + '" style="background:' + setup.COLORS[k][1] + '">' + setup.COLORS[k][0] + '</button>';
    });
  } else {
    '1234567890'.split('').forEach(function (d) { keys += '<button type="button" class="ck" data-add="' + d + '">' + d + '</button>'; });
  }
  pad.html('<div class="cscreen"><input class="cin" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" ' +
    (kind === 'colors' ? 'placeholder="type the colours, e.g. red blue..."' : 'inputmode="numeric" placeholder="type the code"') + '></div>' +
    '<div class="ckeys ' + kind + '">' + keys + '<button type="button" class="ck clr">clear</button><button type="button" class="ck go">ENTER</button></div><div class="cmsg"></div>');
};
setup.submitPad = function (pad) {
  var kind = pad.attr('data-kind') || 'digits', got = setup.normCode(kind, pad.find('.cin').val());
  if (!got) { return; }
  if (got === setup.normCode(kind, pad.attr('data-answer'))) {
    pad.addClass('ok').find('.cmsg').text('ACCEPTED');
    setTimeout(function () { Engine.play(pad.attr('data-ok')); }, 600);
    return;
  }
  if (pad.attr('data-fail') === 'boiler') {
    var v = State.variables; v.codeTries = (v.codeTries || 0) + 1;
    Engine.play(v.codeTries >= 2 ? 'Boiler Ending' : 'Hotel Keypad Wrong');
    return;
  }
  pad.removeClass('bad'); void pad[0].offsetWidth; pad.addClass('bad');
  pad.find('.cmsg').text('WRONG CODE'); pad.find('.cin').val('').focus();
};
$(document).on(':passagedisplay', function () { $('#passages .codepad').each(function () { setup.buildPad(this); }); });
$(document).on('click', '.codepad .ck', function () {
  var b = $(this), pad = b.closest('.codepad'), inp = pad.find('.cin');
  if (b.hasClass('go')) { setup.submitPad(pad); return; }
  if (b.hasClass('clr')) { inp.val(''); return; }
  var kind = pad.attr('data-kind'), add = b.attr('data-add'), cur = inp.val();
  if (kind !== 'colors' && cur.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '').length >= +(pad.attr('data-len') || 8)) { return; }
  inp.val(kind === 'colors' ? (cur ? cur + ' ' : '') + add : cur + add);
});
$(document).on('keydown', '.codepad .cin', function (e) { if (e.key === 'Enter') { e.preventDefault(); setup.submitPad($(this).closest('.codepad')); } });

:: Lost Your Mind [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_lostmind]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The yellow walls start smiling back at you.</p><p>Your sanity ran out and you were never seen again.</p><p>Sanity ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Unarmed [ending]
<div class="story-text"><p>You try to fight it with your bare hands.</p><p>It doesn't go well. Maybe you should have picked up a weapon.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Level 1 [flicker]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level1]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Level 1. The habitable zone.</p><p>Concrete floors, puddles, and lights that buzz and flicker. Somewhere far away, something drips.</p><p>Supply crates are stacked against one of the pillars.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Search the crates|Level 1 Crates]][[Follow the flickering lights|Level 1 Dark Hall]]</div>

:: Level 1 Crates [flicker]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_crates]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The crates are full of almond water. Someone left a crowbar leaning against them.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("l1water")>><span id="pk1"><<link "Take a bottle of almond water">><<if setup.take("l1water","almond")>><<replace "#pk1">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></span><</if>><<if !setup.isTaken("l1crowbar")>><span id="pk2"><<link "Take the crowbar">><<if setup.take("l1crowbar","crowbar")>><<replace "#pk2">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></span><</if>>[[Keep going|Level 1 Dark Hall]]</div>

:: Level 1 Dark Hall
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_darkhall]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The lights die one by one. In the last flicker you see it: something tall, with arms that are much too long.</p><p>It hasn't seen you yet. Hide. Now.</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Hide behind a pillar|Level 1 Hidden]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:3s"></span></div>
<<timed 3s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[It sees you|Skin Stealer Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Skin Stealer Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_darkhall]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>It reaches you in two steps.</p><p>When the lights come back on, there are two of you in the hallway. Only one of them is still you.</p><p>Skin stealer ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Level 1 Hidden [flicker]
<<if !setup.isTaken("whidden")>><div class="find" id="fwhidden"><<link "💧 There's a bottle of almond water here. Take it">><<if setup.take("whidden","almond")>><<replace "#fwhidden">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></div><</if>>
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level1]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You press yourself against the cold concrete and hold your breath.</p><p>It walks right past you. For one second its face looks exactly like Dad's.</p><p>Then it is gone. Further down the hall, you hear music. Party music.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Follow the music|Level Fun]][[Take the stairwell instead|Level 1 Stairwell]]</div>

:: Level 1 Stairwell [flicker]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level1]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You climb a rusty stairwell. At the top, a familiar voice calls your name.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Go towards the voice|You made it (Q44)]]</div>

:: Level Fun [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelfun]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>=) Welcome to Level Fun! =)</p><p>Balloons, streamers, and a long table with a cake. Tall yellow partygoers are crowded around it, their drawn-on smiles stretched much too wide.</p><p>They haven't seen you. Partygoers hunt by sound. If they hear you, they will chase you. Stay quiet.</p><p>The music never stops. You can feel your mind slipping faster in here.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Sneak along the wall|Level Fun Exits]][[Grab a slice of cake|Party Cake Ending]][[Say hello|Party Chase]][[Smile back at them|Smile Ending]]</div>

:: Level Fun Exits [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funexits]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You make it past the party table without a sound. Behind it there are two doors.</p><p>A bright red door with a glowing EXIT sign, and a plain grey door marked LEVEL 1.</p><p>The note about the almond water said to avoid red things... and the grey door looks old and squeaky.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Take the red EXIT|Red Door Ending]][[Ease the grey door open slowly|Level 1 Stairwell]][[Run for the grey door|Party Chase]]</div>

:: Party Chase [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_partychase]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The music stops.</p><p>Every smiling face turns toward you at once. They heard you. =)</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Sprint for the grey door|Level 1 Stairwell]][[Dive under the party table|Under the Party Table]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:2.5s"></span></div>
<<timed 2.5s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[They catch you|Partygoer Caught Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Under the Party Table [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelfun]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You squeeze under the tablecloth and hold your breath.</p><p>Yellow feet shuffle past, inches from your face. Someone giggles. Then the music starts again and they drift back to the cake.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Crawl out the other side, quietly|Level Fun Exits]]</div>

:: Partygoer Caught Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_partychase]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Long yellow arms wrap around you and lift you off the ground.</p><p>"Why so serious? =)" They carry you back to the party. You are never allowed to leave.</p><p>Partygoer ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Party Cake Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelfun]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The cake is warm and sweet and full of teeth.</p><p>The partygoers clap as you stop moving. =)</p><p>Party ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Smile Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_lostmind]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You smile back. And you can't stop.</p><p>Your face stretches wider and wider. You are one of them now. =)</p><p>Partygoer ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Red Door Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funexits]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The EXIT opens onto nothing but red.</p><p>You fall for a very, very long time.</p><p>Red door ending</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Fun With The Virus [fun]
<<if !setup.isTaken("wv1")>><div class="find" id="fwv1"><<link "💧 There's a bottle of almond water here. Take it">><<if setup.take("wv1","almond")>><<replace "#fwv1">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></div><</if>>
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funvirus]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-14%;top:8%;width:75.0%;height:75.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The music gets louder. Streamers, balloons, the smell of cake. You are back in Level Fun.</p><p>The virus crouches beside you behind a balloon stand. "Since my mutation I can hear their hearts," it whispers. "Seven of them... no. Eight."</p><p>"Stay close to me."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Sneak behind the virus|Present Hallway]][[Pop a balloon to distract them|Balloon Distraction]][[Let the virus fight them|Virus Fight]]</div>

:: Balloon Distraction [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelfun]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:52%;top:10%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You squeeze a balloon until it goes POP.</p><p>Every partygoer turns at the same time, toward the sound. They shuffle over to it, giggling. =)</p><p>The virus grabs your arm with one of its long claws and pulls you the other way.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Slip away|Present Hallway]]</div>

:: Virus Fight [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funroar]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:6%;top:-2%;width:100.0%;height:100.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The virus steps out from behind the balloons. Its tendrils flex, twelve times stronger than before.</p><p>It throws three partygoers across the room like party favours.</p><p>Then the music stops. Every smiling face in the room turns to look at YOU.</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Run while the virus holds them off|Present Hallway]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:3s"></span></div>
<<timed 3s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[They grab you|Party Forever Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Present Hallway [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhall]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:45%;top:14%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>A long hallway stacked with wrapped presents.</p><p>One big yellow present has a tag on it: FOR YOU =)</p><p>The virus sniffs it. Its tendrils curl back. "That one smells wrong."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Open your present|Present Ending]][[Let the virus open it|Virus Opens The Present]][[Leave it and keep moving|The Way Out]]</div>

:: Virus Opens The Present [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhall]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:45%;top:14%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The virus rips the paper open with one claw.</p><p>A burst of confetti... and a party hat. Underneath is a note: YOU ARE INVITED. FOREVER. =)</p><p>The virus eats the note. "Keep the hat," it says. "They like hats."</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<link "Take the party hat" "The Way Out">><<run setup.addItem("hat")>><</link>>[[Leave it|The Way Out]]</div>

:: The Way Out [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhold]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:22%;top:10%;width:85.0%;height:85.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>At the end of the hallway is a grey door marked WAY OUT.</p><p>In front of it stands the biggest partygoer you have ever seen. Its smile stretches all the way around its head.</p><p>The virus moves in front of you.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if setup.has("hat")>><<link "Put on the party hat and walk past" "Party Hat Escape">><</link>><</if>>[[Let the virus hold it back|The Virus Holds The Door]][[Run past it|Biggest Partygoer Ending]]</div>

:: Party Hat Escape [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhold]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:22%;top:10%;width:85.0%;height:85.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You put on the party hat and smile the widest smile you can.</p><p>The giant partygoer looks at you for a long time. Then it waves. =)</p><p>You walk right past it. The virus follows, trying very hard to look like a balloon.<<set $virusWith to true>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Through the door|Level 2 Pipe Dreams]]</div>

:: The Virus Holds The Door [fun]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhold]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:22%;top:10%;width:85.0%;height:85.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The virus wraps every tendril it has around the giant partygoer and holds on.</p><p>"GO!" it shouts. "I always find you. I will find you again."</p><p>You run through the door. Behind you the music starts again.<<set $virusWith to false>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Keep running|Level 2 Pipe Dreams]]</div>

:: Party Forever Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_partychase]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>They pull you into the middle of the room and put a party hat on your head.</p><p>The party never ends. Neither do you. =)</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Present Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhall]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You pull the ribbon. The box opens by itself.</p><p>Something inside is smiling. Some surprises are not good surprises.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Biggest Partygoer Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_funhold]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You try to duck under its arm.</p><p>Its arm is much, much longer than you thought.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Level 2 Pipe Dreams
<<if !setup.isTaken("wl2")>><div class="find" id="fwl2"><<link "💧 There's a bottle of almond water here. Take it">><<if setup.take("wl2","almond")>><<replace "#fwl2">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></div><</if>>
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level2]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:55%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level2]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>You fall through a hatch and land on hot metal. Level 2: Pipe Dreams.</p><p>Pipes everywhere, hissing steam. The air is so hot it hurts to breathe.</p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus shakes off the confetti. "Two ways out," it says. "One cold, one hot."<<else>>You are alone now. Somewhere behind you, the party music is still playing.<</if>></p><p>A flashlight hangs from a red valve wheel.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("flashlight")>><span id="pkf"><<link "Take the flashlight">><<if setup.take("flashlight","flashlight")>><<replace "#pkf">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></span><</if>>[[Follow the cold blue pipe|Level 4 Abandoned Office]][[Follow the hot red pipe|Steam Ending]]</div>

:: Level 4 Abandoned Office [nodrain]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:55%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The pipe ends at a vent. You crawl out into a quiet office. Level 4.</p><p>Empty cubicles, humming lights, and a water cooler full of almond water. It feels... safe. Your sanity stops dropping here.</p><p>One computer is still on. A sticky note on it says: "Lights out is next. Bring a light."</p></div>
<div class="choices"><span id="cool"><<link "Drink from the water cooler">><<run setup.fill(false)>><<replace "#cool">><</replace>><</link>></span>[[Read the computer|Office Computer]][[Take the stairs down|Level 6 Lights Out]]</div>

:: Office Computer [nodrain]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:55%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The screen flickers. Someone typed a message and never sent it:</p><p>"THE LEVELS KEEP GOING DOWN. THE EXIT IS NOT ALWAYS AN EXIT. IF YOU HEAR WHISPERING IN THE DARK, GO THE OTHER WAY. IF THE LIGHTS TURN RED, RUN."</p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus reads over your shoulder. "Good advice," it mutters.<<else>>Under it, someone has scratched a smiley face into the desk. =)<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Take the stairs down|Level 6 Lights Out]]</div>

:: Level 6 Lights Out
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level6]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The stairs end. The lights go out. Level 6: Lights Out.</p><p>You can't see your own hands. On your left, something is whispering. On your right, a pair of red eyes blinks... then another pair.</p><p><<if setup.has("flashlight")>>Your flashlight is in your inventory.<<else>>You wish you had a light.<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if setup.has("flashlight")>>[[Turn on the flashlight|Lights Out Flashlight]]<</if>>[[Walk toward the whispering|Whispers Ending]][[Walk toward the faint hum of a light|Level Run For Your Life]]</div>

:: Lights Out Flashlight
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level6]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:20%;top:14%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level6]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>Click. The beam cuts through the dark.</p><p>The red eyes belong to things that hate light. They scream and scatter.</p><p>In the beam you see a narrow hallway with a door at the end, and the walls of the hallway are red.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Go to the red hallway|Level Run For Your Life]]</div>

:: Level Run For Your Life
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelrun]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The lights snap on. Every single one of them is red. Level !: Run For Your Life.</p><p>Down the hall, the dark is moving. It is coming toward you, fast.</p><p>At the far end, a heavy door is sliding shut.</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[RUN|Run For Your Life 2]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:2.5s"></span></div>
<<timed 2.5s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[It catches you|Run For Your Life Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Run For Your Life 2
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelrun]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:2%;top:8%;width:90.0%;height:90.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You sprint. Your lungs burn. The door is closing faster.</p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus grabs you with every tendril it has and throws you toward the gap.<<else>>Then the wall next to you splits open. The virus bursts out. "Told you," it says. "I always find you."<</if>></p><p>SLIDE!</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Slide under the door|Level Run Escape]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:2s"></span></div>
<<timed 2s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[The door slams shut|Run For Your Life Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Level Run Escape
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:30%;top:10%;width:85.0%;height:85.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You slide under the door just before it slams shut. Behind it, something hits the metal again and again... then it stops.</p><p>You are lying on cool carpet. The virus sits down next to you, breathing hard.</p><p><<set $virusWith to true>>"We are deeper than anyone has ever gone," it says. "And I think I know where the real exit is."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Next|Hotel Arrival]]</div>

:: Steam Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level2]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The red pipe gets hotter and hotter.</p><p>A valve bursts. The steam is the last thing you ever feel.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Whispers Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level6]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The whispering knows your name.</p><p>It says it one more time, right behind your ear. Then the dark closes in.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Run For Your Life Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_levelrun]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You were not fast enough.</p><p>The lights flicker red one last time. Then nothing.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Hotel Arrival
<<set $virusWith to true>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_arrive]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-6%;top:14%;width:75.0%;height:75.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You crawl out of a vent into the cold night air. Across the street is a huge old hotel, every window glowing gold.</p><p>Level 5: The Grand Hotel. A banner over the door says CHECK-IN ANYTIME. CHECK-OUT NEVER. =)</p><p>"The real exit is in there," the virus says. "Down in the boiler room. I have smelled it before. But the door will be locked."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Push through the revolving door|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Lobby [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_lobby]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:58%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_lobby]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The lobby is enormous. A chandelier the size of a car hangs over a red carpet that goes on and on.</p><p>There is a reception desk with a little gold bell, a grand staircase, an elevator, and tall doors marked BALLROOM. Music drifts out from behind them.</p><p><<if $power>>The elevator light is on now.<<else>>The elevator is dark. Its OUT OF ORDER sign is swinging slowly, even though there is no wind.<</if>></p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus keeps low, sniffing the carpet. "Find the brass key," it whispers. "And find out the code."<<else>>You are alone. The music gets louder, like it noticed.<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Go to the front desk|Hotel Front Desk]][[Read the guest book|Hotel Guest Book]][[Go into the ballroom|Hotel Ballroom]][[Climb the grand staircase|Hotel Staircase]]<<if $power>>[[Take the elevator|Hotel Elevator]]<<else>>[[Press the elevator button|Hotel Elevator Dead]]<</if>></div>

:: Hotel Guest Book [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-6%;top:14%;width:75.0%;height:75.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The guest book is open. Most pages are blank. The last few have notes scribbled in different handwriting:</p><p>"Room 211: whatever you do, DON'T watch the TV."</p><p>"Room 217: it sounds like someone you know. DO NOT ANSWER."</p><p>"Floor 3: if the hallway gets longer, walk BACKWARDS."</p><p>"The boiler room key is where you sleep. (213)"</p><p>"The band knows the code. Listen to the band."</p><p>The very last line is fresh, the ink still wet: "Welcome back. =)"</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Front Desk [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-6%;top:14%;width:75.0%;height:75.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>Nobody is behind the desk. Behind it, rows and rows of gold key hooks, all empty.</p><p>A little card next to the bell says: RING ONCE FOR SERVICE. ONLY ONCE.</p><p>Someone has scratched words into the wood of the desk: ASK NICELY.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Ring the bell|Hotel Concierge]][[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Concierge [hotel]
<<set $bell to ($bell || 0) + 1>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p><<if $bell gt 1>>DING. Again.<<else>>DING.<</if>></p><p>Something stands up from behind the desk. It keeps standing up. It is very, very tall, in a red uniform with gold buttons. Its face is smooth like an egg, except for a faint painted smile.</p><p>"Welcome to the Grand Hotel," it says, though its mouth does not move. "How may I help you, guest? =)"</p></div>
<<if $bell gt 1>><div class="choices">[[...|Bell Ending]]</div><<else>><div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("roomkey")>><<link "Ask politely for a room" "Hotel Concierge Key">><<run setup.take("roomkey","roomkey")>><</link>><</if>>[[Ask where the exit is|Checkout Ending]][[Ring the bell again|Bell Ending]][[Back away slowly|Hotel Lobby]]</div><</if>>

:: Hotel Concierge Key [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>"Of course," it says. One long white glove slides a key across the desk. Room 213.</p><p><<if setup.has("roomkey")>>You put the key in your inventory.<<else>>Your pockets are full. The key clatters onto the desk. You can come back for it after you make room.<</if>></p><p>"Enjoy your stay. Forever." It sinks back down behind the desk until you can't see it anymore.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.has("roomkey")>><<link "Pick up the key" "Hotel Concierge Key">><<run setup.addItem("roomkey")>><</link>><</if>>[[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Ballroom [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_ballroom]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:58%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_ballroom]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The ballroom is full of dancers. They are mannequins: smooth faces, painted smiles, perfect suits and gowns. They waltz in slow circles without making a sound.</p><p>On the stage, a band of mannequins sits frozen around a black piano. There is sheet music on the piano.</p><p>Round tables line the walls, set with candles and glasses.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("wball")>><span id="pkwball"><<link "Search the tables for almond water">><<if setup.take("wball","almond")>><<replace "#pkwball">><</replace>><</if>><</link>></span><</if>>[[Sneak along the wall to the stage|Hotel Stage]][[Join the dance|Hotel Dance]][[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Dance [hotel]
<<set $sanity to Math.max(1, $sanity - 20)>><<set $knowCode to true>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_ballroom]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>A cold hand takes yours. Then you are spinning, round and round, faster and faster.</p><p>The music gets inside your head. You feel your mind slipping. (-20 sanity)</p><p>But as you spin you notice something: the dancers only ever step on three numbered tiles. Four... one... seven. Four... one... seven.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Pull free and stumble out of the dance|Hotel Ballroom]]</div>

:: Hotel Stage [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_ballroom]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You creep up the steps. The sheet music has three big numbers written at the top: 4 1 7.</p><p>The moment you touch it, the music STOPS. Every dancer turns its head toward you at exactly the same time.</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices"><<link "Grab the sheet music and run" "Hotel Lobby">><<run setup.addItem("sheet")>><<set $knowCode to true>><</link>>[[Freeze and pretend to be a mannequin|Dance Forever Ending]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:3s"></span></div>
<<timed 3s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[They grab you|Dance Forever Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Hotel Elevator Dead [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_lobby]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You press the button. Nothing. Then, very faintly, from inside the shaft, someone presses it back.</p><p>A sticker on the panel says: POWER CONTROLS - FLOOR 3.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Staircase [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_lobby]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:58%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_lobby]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The grand staircase splits in three directions.</p><p>Up to FLOOR 2. Further up to FLOOR 3, where the sign has been crossed out with red paint. And a narrow service stair going down to the BASEMENT.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Floor 2|Hotel Floor 2]][[Floor 3|Hotel Floor 3]][[Down to the basement|Hotel Basement Stairs]][[Back to the lobby|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Floor 2 [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:36%;top:22%;width:60.0%;height:60.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>A long hallway of doors. Room 211. Room 213. Room 215 has no handle. Room 217 has light shining under the door... and knocking coming from inside.</p><p>A room service tray sits on the carpet. The food on it is still warm.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Room 211|Hotel Room 211]]<<if setup.has("roomkey")>>[[Unlock Room 213|Hotel Room 213]]<<elseif setup.has("crowbar")>>[[Pry open Room 213 with the crowbar|Hotel Room 213]]<<else>>[[Try Room 213|Hotel Room 213 Locked]]<</if>>[[Room 217|Hotel Room 217]][[Back to the stairs|Hotel Staircase]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 213 Locked [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Locked. A little gold plate on the door says: KEYS AVAILABLE AT RECEPTION.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the hallway|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 211 [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The room is dark except for an old TV playing static. The static is moving in shapes, like it is trying to show you something.</p><p>You can almost see a face in it. A smiling face. It is getting clearer.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Keep watching|Static Ending]][[Turn off the TV|Hotel Room 211 Off]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 211 Off [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Click. The room goes quiet. Taped to the back of the TV is a note:</p><p>"The power room is on floor 3. The hallway will try to keep you. Don't walk forward. WALK BACKWARDS."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the hallway|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 217 [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Knock. Knock. Knock.</p><p>A voice from inside. It sounds exactly like Theo. "Hey! It's me! Let me in, quick, before it comes back!"</p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus's tendrils go stiff. "That is not your friend," it whispers.<<else>>But Theo is not here. Is he?<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Open the door|Knock Ending]][[Knock back three times|Hotel Room 217 Note]][[Walk away|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 217 Note [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Knock. Knock. Knock.</p><p>The voice stops. After a long time, a folded note slides out under the door:</p><p>"you passed the test. the boiler code is the song the band plays. 3 numbers. the dancers know it too, but dancing costs you."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the hallway|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 213 [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:54%;top:16%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>Room 213 is neat and quiet. A made bed, a phone, a wardrobe with its door open a crack.</p><p>In the bathroom, the bathtub is full to the top with almond water.</p><p>Something hard is under one of the pillows.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("bathtub")>><span id="tub"><<link "Drink from the bathtub">><<run setup.fill(false)>><<run State.variables.taken.bathtub = true>><<replace "#tub">><</replace>><</link>></span><</if>><<if !setup.isTaken("brasskey")>><<link "Look under the pillow" "Hotel Room 213 Footsteps">><<run setup.take("brasskey","brasskey")>><</link>><</if>>[[Answer the phone|Hotel Room 213 Phone]][[Back to the hallway|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 213 Phone [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The phone wasn't ringing. You pick it up anyway.</p><p>"Front desk," says a smooth voice. "Housekeeping is on its way to your room. Please stay where you are. =)"</p><p>Click.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Back to the room|Hotel Room 213]]</div>

:: Hotel Room 213 Footsteps [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p><<if setup.has("brasskey")>>A heavy brass key, warm like someone was just holding it. You put it in your inventory.<<else>>A heavy brass key! But your inventory is full. You will have to come back for it.<</if>></p><p>Then you hear it. Squeak... squeak... squeak. A cleaning cart, rolling down the hall. It stops outside your door. The handle starts to turn.</p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Hide in the wardrobe|Hotel Wardrobe]][[Hide under the bed|Hotel Under Bed]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:3s"></span></div>
<<timed 3s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[Housekeeping is here|Housekeeping Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Hotel Wardrobe [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You squeeze into the wardrobe and pull the door almost shut.</p><p>Through the crack you see long red sleeves and white gloves. It makes the bed perfectly. It fluffs the pillows. It turns toward the wardrobe... and stops.</p><p>"Enjoy your stay," it says to no one, and leaves.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !setup.isTaken("brasskey")>><<link "Grab the key now" "Hotel Room 213">><<run setup.take("brasskey","brasskey")>><</link>><</if>>[[Sneak back out to the hallway|Hotel Floor 2]]</div>

:: Hotel Under Bed [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You slide under the bed. It is dusty and dark down here.</p><p>Two very long legs walk in. Then the top of a smooth, smiling face lowers slowly into view, upside down, looking right at you.</p><p>"Housekeeping," it whispers.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[...|Housekeeping Ending]]</div>

:: Hotel Floor 3 [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall3]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:40%;top:26%;width:45.0%;height:45.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall3]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>Floor 3 looks like a normal hallway. Doors, lamps, carpet.</p><p>You take a step. The hallway stretches. You take another. It stretches again. The door you came through is a tiny dot far behind you.</p><p>The patterns on the wallpaper are starting to look like smiles.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Keep walking forward|Hotel Floor 3 Deeper]][[Walk backwards|Hotel Power Room]][[Run back to the stairs|Hotel Staircase]]</div>

:: Hotel Floor 3 Deeper [hotel]
<<set $sanity to Math.max(1, $sanity - 10)>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall3]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Forward. Forward. The hallway never ends. The room numbers go up and up: 340, 380, 399, 3000...</p><p>The smiles on the wallpaper are definitely smiles now. (-10 sanity)</p><p><<if $virusWith>>The virus wraps a tendril around your wrist. "Backwards," it says. "Now."<<else>>You remember something about walking backwards.<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Keep going forward|Endless Hall Ending]][[Walk backwards|Hotel Power Room]]</div>

:: Hotel Power Room [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_power]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-4%;top:14%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_power]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>You walk backwards, one step at a time, eyes closed. When you open them you are standing in a humming room full of fuse boxes.</p><p>A huge lever on the wall says ELEVATOR. It is pointing at OFF.</p><p><<if $power>>The lever is already pointing at ON.<</if>></p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if !$power>><<link "Pull the lever" "Hotel Power On">><<set $power to true>><</link>><</if>>[[Walk backwards out of the room|Hotel Staircase]]</div>

:: Hotel Power On [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_power]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>CLUNK. The lights flicker, then burn brighter. Far below you hear a cheerful DING.</p><p>The elevator works now. It can take you straight down to the basement.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Walk backwards out of the room|Hotel Staircase]]</div>

:: Hotel Elevator [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_elevator]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:12%;top:16%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_elevator]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The elevator is gold and velvet and smells like old perfume. Soft music plays.</p><p>The buttons say 3, 2, L and B. A tiny sign under the B says: STAFF ONLY.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Press B|Hotel Boiler Door]][[Press 2|Hotel Floor 2]][[Press 3|Hotel Floor 3]][[Press L|Hotel Lobby]]</div>

:: Hotel Basement Stairs [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_stairs]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The service stairs go down into the dark. At the bottom, something long and black is lying across the steps, breathing slowly.</p><p>A hound. Its white eyes are open. It is listening.</p><p><<if setup.has("flashlight")>>Your flashlight might scare it. Or it might make it angry.<</if>></p></div>
<div id="opts" class="choices">[[Hold your breath and tiptoe past it|Hotel Boiler Door]]<<if setup.has("flashlight")>>[[Shine the flashlight in its eyes|Hound Ending]]<</if>>[[Go back up|Hotel Staircase]]</div>
<div class="timerbar"><span style="animation-duration:4s"></span></div>
<<timed 4s>><<replace "#opts">><div class="caught">[[It smells you|Hound Ending]]</div><</replace>><<run $(".timerbar").remove()>><</timed>>

:: Hotel Boiler Door [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boilerdoor]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:-4%;top:14%;width:70.0%;height:70.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boilerdoor]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>A heavy red steel door: BOILER ROOM. EMPLOYEES ONLY. It has a big brass keyhole and a keypad that wants a 3-digit code.</p><p><<if setup.has("brasskey")>>The brass key in your inventory is warm, almost hot.<<else>>You don't have a key for that keyhole.<</if>></p><p>You will have to type the code in yourself. Hope you remember it.</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if setup.has("brasskey")>>[[Unlock the door and use the keypad|Hotel Keypad]]<</if>><<if $power>>[[Take the elevator back up|Hotel Elevator]]<<else>>[[Go back up the stairs|Hotel Staircase]]<</if>></div>

:: Hotel Keypad [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boilerdoor]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The brass key turns with a heavy CLUNK. The keypad lights up green: ENTER CODE.</p><p>Behind the door, the boiler rumbles like it is waiting.</p></div>
<div class="codepad" data-kind="digits" data-len="3" data-ok="Hotel Boiler Room" data-fail="boiler" data-answer="417"></div>
<div class="choices"><<if $power>>[[Step away from the keypad|Hotel Elevator]]<<else>>[[Step away from the keypad|Hotel Staircase]]<</if>></div>

:: Hotel Keypad Wrong [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boilerdoor]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>BZZZT. The keypad flashes red: WRONG.</p><p>The whole door shakes. The pressure gauge needle swings into the red. Steam screams out of a pipe.</p><p>A sign you didn't notice before: TWO WRONG CODES = PRESSURE RELEASE.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again, carefully|Hotel Keypad]]<<if $power>>[[Leave and find the code|Hotel Elevator]]<<else>>[[Leave and find the code|Hotel Staircase]]<</if>></div>

:: Hotel Boiler Room [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:8%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>BEEP. The door swings open onto a room full of fire and steam. A giant boiler roars in the middle.</p><p>On the far wall: a plain grey door with a green EXIT sign. The real exit.</p><p>And standing next to it, very tall, very patient, is the Concierge. "Checking out, guest? =)"</p></div>
<div class="choices"><<if setup.has("roomkey")>>[[Hand back your room key|Hotel Checkout Polite]]<</if>><<if setup.hasWeapon()>>[[Fight the Concierge|Hotel Fight Concierge]]<</if>><<if $virusWith>>[[Let the virus distract it|Hotel Virus Distracts]]<</if>>[[Run for the exit|Checkout Ending]]</div>

:: Hotel Checkout Polite [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You walk up and hold out the key to Room 213. "I'd like to check out, please."</p><p>The Concierge looks at the key for a long time. Then it bows. "A polite guest. How rare." It opens the exit door for you.</p><p>"Do come again. =)"</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Walk through the exit|Hotel Exit]]</div>

:: Hotel Fight Concierge [hotel]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p><<if setup.has("sword")>>You raise the sword.<<else>>You swing the crowbar.<</if>> The Concierge reaches for you with its long white gloves.</p><p>You hit it right in its smooth smiling face. It cracks like porcelain. It stumbles back into the boiler... and the fire takes it.</p><p>The exit door is clear.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Run through the exit|Hotel Exit]]</div>

:: Hotel Virus Distracts [hotel]
<<if $virusWith>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:8%;top:12%;width:80.0%;height:80.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div><<else>><div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boiler]]</div></div><</if>>
<div class="story-text"><p>The virus rises up to its full height, twelve times stronger, and wraps itself around the Concierge.</p><p>"GO! Through the door!" It drags the tall thing toward the boiler as you run past.</p><p>You hear a crash and a roar of fire. Then the virus comes limping through the steam after you, smoking but grinning.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Through the exit together|Hotel Exit]]</div>

:: Hotel Exit
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_level4]]</div><div class="pos" style="left:30%;top:10%;width:85.0%;height:85.0%"><div class="pos clip" style="left:33.930%;top:17.297%;width:21.175%;height:80.481%"><div class="crop" style="left:-44.01%;top:-17.29%;width:190.37%;height:118.73%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:25.454%;top:18.477%;width:6.622%;height:50.690%;transform:rotate(63.30deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-130.83%;top:-61.77%;width:608.68%;height:188.50%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div><div class="pos clip" style="left:57.587%;top:28.067%;width:5.439%;height:49.521%;transform:rotate(-47.66deg)"><div class="crop" style="left:-431.55%;top:-80.61%;width:741.07%;height:221.97%">[img[img_Qimage79]]</div></div></div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The exit door slams shut behind you. The heat, the music and the smiles are gone.</p><p>You are standing on cool carpet under buzzing lights. Somewhere ahead, you can hear wind. Real wind.</p><p>"We are close now," the virus says. "Closer than anyone."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Next|To be continued... (Q83)]]</div>

:: Checkout Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>"The exit?" The Concierge leans down until its smooth face is right in front of yours.</p><p>"Guests don't leave. Guests STAY." Your stay at the Grand Hotel lasts forever. =)</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Bell Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_desk]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>DING. DING.</p><p>The Concierge's painted smile cracks open into a real mouth. "ONLY. ONCE."</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Static Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The face in the static smiles wider and wider.</p><p>When the TV turns off by itself, the room is empty. The face on the screen looks like yours now.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Knock Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall2]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You open the door. It isn't Theo.</p><p>It just used his voice. It can use yours now too.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Housekeeping Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_room]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The door opens. Long red sleeves, white gloves.</p><p>"Housekeeping," it says, and tucks you in. Forever.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Endless Hall Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_hall3]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>You keep walking. Room 4000. Room 9000. Room ∞.</p><p>You never reach the end of floor 3. Nobody does.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Dance Forever Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_ballroom]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>Cold hands grab you and pull you onto the dance floor.</p><p>Your face goes smooth. Your smile gets painted on. You dance forever. =)</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Hound Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_stairs]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>The hound's white eyes snap toward you.</p><p>It moves faster than anything that size should be able to move.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>

:: Boiler Ending [ending]
<div class="scene"><div class="pos bg">[img[art_h_boilerdoor]]</div></div>
<div class="story-text"><p>BZZZT. WRONG. The gauge spins into the red.</p><p>PRESSURE RELEASE. The whole basement fills with scalding steam.</p></div>
<div class="choices">[[Try again|Start]]</div>
